OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FAfter his brother's suicide, Ben
OL,7,     FWest asked strangers to write
OL,8,     Fletters of hope to help others.
OL,9,     FThe UK mental health campaigner
OL,10,     Fwants to offer people in crisis
OL,11,     F'reasons to stay.'.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1974, Francisco Franco's regime
OL,14,     Fexecuted two men by garrote, a
OL,15,     Fmetal collar tightened by a screw
OL,16,     Fto break the neck. Catalan
OL,17,     Fanarchist Salvador Puig Antich was
OL,18,     Fone of them.
