OL,11,G0432 In the Studio
OL,12,     FMost artists depict light. James
OL,13,     FTurrell works with light, that is
OL,14,     Fthe material for his famous
OL,15,     FSkyspaces. We join him working on
OL,16,     Fhis latest, a monumental work in
OL,17,     FAarhus, Denmark.
